== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @chopped onion{1/20%cup}, @chopped fresh chives{3/5%tsp}, @Oceankist cooked mussel meat{1/5%lb}, @minced garlic{1/5%tsp}, @chopped fresh rosemary{1/5%tsp}, @black pepper{1/20%tsp}, @white wine{1/20%cup}, @olive oil{2/5%tsp}, @canned chopped tomatoes{1/5%cup}.

